We have no permitting records for the subject location beyond what is avail=
able on NCDHHS GIS and local Tax GIS (attached).

Environmental mitigation verification is a function of NC DHHS.

It is not administered or otherwise governed by the NC building codes enfor=
ced by Durham Building and Safety.

Disturbed substrate mitigation will require full depth engineering analysis=
 and design for any construction permits.

